{"name":"The Galaxy Lamp","slug":"glyph-galaxy-lamp","blurb":"On the depth street, Zia carries the lamp toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Galaxy. Click the lamp and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Galaxy Lamp.","seal":"373fb5ebf3372ac5a3ceb892efab03a1b1babc8bd2425cd9ec251088f42d3328"}
